Usage: cargo run --release --manifest-path tools/perf-baseline/Cargo.toml -- [OPTIONS]

Options:
--samples N                 Samples per case (default: 15)
--warmup N                  Untimed iterations per case (default: 3)
--filesystem-cache LIST     Filesystem states: warm,cold-requested,cold-verified
--filesystem-root PATH      Parent directory for filesystem samples
--case LIST                 zip_index,zip_read_one,opc_open,opc_open_owned,
